				<r3d:description language="eng">This data repository allows users to publish animal tracking datasets that have been uploaded to Movebank (https://www.movebank.org/ ). Published datasets have gone through a submission and review process, and are typically associated with a written study published in an academic journal. All animal tracking data in this repository are available to the public.
In addition, analysis workflows assembled via MoveApps (https://www.moveapps.org/) can be published in a persistently citable manner.</r3d:description>
